td><mi>x</mi></mtd><mtd><mi></mi><mo>≡</mo><mn>392</mn></mtd><mtd></mtd><mtd><mi></mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mtext>mod</mtext><mstyle scriptlevel=\"0\"><mspace width=\"0.222em\"></mspace></mstyle><mn>101</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd><mi>x</mi></mtd><mtd><mi></mi><mo>≡</mo><mn>101</mn><mo>⋅</mo><mn>3</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>89</mn></mtd><mtd></mtd><mtd><mi></mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mtext>mod</mtext><mstyle scriptlevel=\"0\"><mspace width=\"0.222em\"></mspace></mstyle><mn>101</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd><mi>x</mi></mtd><mtd><mi></mi><mo>≡</mo><mn>89</mn></mtd><mtd></mtd><mtd><mi></mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mtext>mod</mtext><mstyle scriptlevel=\"0\"><mspace width=\"0.222em\"></mspace></mstyle><mn>101</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mtd></mtr></mtable></math></mjx-assistive-mml></mjx-container></p>\n<p>So, we get the solution <mjx-container class=\"MathJax CtxtMenu_Attached_0\" jax=\"CHTML\" tabindex=\"0\" ctxtmenu_counter=\"136\" style=\"font-size: 119.4%; position: relative;\"><mjx-math class=\"MJX-TEX\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><mjx-mi class=\"mjx-i\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c1D465 TEX-I\"></mjx-c></mjx-mi><mjx-mo class=\"mjx-n\" space=\"4\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c2261\"></mjx-c></mjx-mo><mjx-mn class=\"mjx-n\" space=\"4\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c38\"></mjx-c><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c39\"></mjx-c></mjx-mn><mjx-mstyle><mjx-mspace style=\"width: 0.222em;\"></mjx-mspace></mjx-mstyle><mjx-mo class=\"mjx-n\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c28\"></mjx-c></mjx-mo><mjx-mtext class=\"mjx-n\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c6D\"></mjx-c><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c6F\"></mjx-c><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c64\"></mjx-c></mjx-mtext><mjx-mstyle><mjx-mspace style=\"width: 0.222em;\"></mjx-mspace></mjx-mstyle><mjx-mn class=\"mjx-n\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c31\"></mjx-c><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c30\"></mjx-c><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c31\"></mjx-c></mjx-mn><mjx-mo class=\"mjx-n\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c29\"></mjx-c></mjx-mo><mjx-mo class=\"mjx-n\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c2E\"></mjx-c></mjx-mo></mjx-math><mjx-assistive-mml unselectable=\"on\" display=\"inline\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>x</mi><mo>≡</mo><mn>89</mn><mstyle scriptlevel=\"0\"><mspace width=\"0.222em\"></mspace></mstyle><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mtext>mod</mtext><mstyle scriptlevel=\"0\"><mspace width=\"0.222em\"></mspace></mstyle><mn>101</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>.</mo></math></mjx-assistive-mml></mjx-container></p>\n<p>But our original congruence was modulo <mjx-container class=\"MathJax CtxtMenu_Attached_0\" jax=\"CHTML\" tabindex=\"0\" ctxtmenu_counter=\"137\" style=\"font-size: 119.4%; position: relative;\"><mjx-math class=\"MJX-TEX\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><mjx-mn class=\"mjx-n\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c34\"></mjx-c><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c30\"></mjx-c><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c34\"></mjx-c></mjx-mn></mjx-math><mjx-assistive-mml unselectable=\"on\" display=\"inline\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>404</mn></math></mjx-assistive-mml></mjx-container> (not modulo <mjx-container class=\"MathJax CtxtMenu_Attached_0\" jax=\"CHTML\" tabindex=\"0\" ctxtmenu_counter=\"138\" style=\"font-size: 119.4%; position: relative;\"><mjx-math class=\"MJX-TEX\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><mjx-mn class=\"mjx-n\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c31\"></mjx-c><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c30\"></mjx-c><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c31\"></mjx-c></mjx-mn></mjx-math><mjx-assistive-mml unselectable=\"on\" display=\"inline\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>101</mn></math></mjx-assistive-mml></mjx-container>). To find all the solutions modulo <mjx-container class=\"MathJax CtxtMenu_Attached_0\" jax=\"CHTML\" tabindex=\"0\" ctxtmenu_counter=\"139\" style=\"font-size: 119.4%; position: relative;\"><mjx-math class=\"MJX-TEX\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><mjx-mn class=\"mjx-n\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c34\"></mjx-c><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c30\"></mjx-c><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c34\"></mjx-c></mjx-mn><mjx-mo class=\"mjx-n\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c2C\"></mjx-c></mjx-mo></mjx-math><mjx-assistive-mml unselectable=\"o